  title: Through stone
  description: This spell can target any hero, including the caster. This hero can
    pass through as many walls as the number of points rolled on the dice during
    their next movement. Beware! The dark-colored areas on the maps are solid rock.
    If the hero ends their movement there, they will be imprisoned forever!
